---
interface Member {
  name: string;
  github: string;
  avatar: string;
}

interface Props {
  members: Member[];
}

const { members } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
      We are Team Teritama.
    </h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-left">
      <div>
        <h3
          class="font-bold text-slate-900 border-l-2 border-orange-400 pl-3 mb-2 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm"
        >
          Creative
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          ただ作るのではなく、遊び心と驚きを大切に。新しい技術を楽しみながらプロダクトへ昇華させます。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3
          class="font-bold text-slate-900 border-l-2 border-orange-400 pl-3 mb-2 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm"
        >
          Agile
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          アイデアをすぐに形に。2022年から絶え間なく続くアウトプットが私たちの誇りです。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3
          class="font-bold text-slate-900 border-l-2 border-orange-400 pl-3 mb-2 uppercase tracking-widest text-sm"
        >
          Human-Centric
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          福祉から教育、エンタメまで。人の体温が通うようなデジタル体験を追求しています。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20">
      <h3
        class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-8"
      >
        Core Members
      </h3>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-12">
        {
          members.map((member) => (
            <a
              href={member.github}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="group flex flex-col items-center"
            >
              <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-2 border-slate-100 group-hover:border-orange-200 transition-colors mb-3 bg-slate-50 shadow-sm">
                <img
                  src={member.avatar}
                  alt={member.name}
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors tracking-wider">
                @{member.name}
              </span>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
